    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n934" root="افخ" body-key="A">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَفْخٌ</span></b> , (L,) <i>He,</i> [or <i>it</i>] <i>struck him,</i> or <i>hit him,</i> [or
<i>hurt him,</i>] <i>on the part of his head called the</i>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَأْفُوخ</span>. (A'Obeyd, S, L, Msb, K.) He who pronounces <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يافوخ</span> without <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ء</span> says <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَفَخَهُ</span>. (Msb.)

